  "rendered_output": {
    "it_geo_05 right": "stage08_render emits <figure> wrapping the 'Sopra: Figura 3' caption with its photograph — the pair reaches the reader.",
    "it_geo_05 left": "the ejected 'Figura 2' caption also renders inside the correct figure, but via stage08_render's ADJACENCY FALLBACK (a caption with no figure_ref groups with the preceding figure block), not via this pass. So an abstention does not leave a caption standing alone in the output; it hands the decision to the weakest rule available."
  }
